DRVEC 0.13 -- forecasts from a VEC(1) model
input=dfc.inp p=2 q=0 r=1 case=2 freq=1 horizon=8 bands=95%
Levels in each series' own units (deterministic path added back, refactor divided out, Box-Cox inverted: the median under a log).  Columns 1..1 are the Y2 block, 2..2 the Y1 block.
Low/High are +/- 1.9600 standard errors in the model's units, transformed at both ends; s.e. by the delta method and are THEORETICAL: they assume the specification is right.

